>
> ethtool -i eth2
> driver: ixgbe
> version: 2.0.84-k2
> firmware-version: 1.12-2
> bus-info: 0000:03:00.0
>
>
>
> Normally without ifb and redirect netperf show:
> TCP STREAM TEST from 0.0.0.0 (0.0.0.0) port 0 AF_INET to 192.168.0.2 
> (192.168.0.2) port 0 AF_INET
