>
> Steps to reproduce panic:
> ip link set dev ifb0 up
>
> tc qdisc add dev eth2 ingress
>
> tc filter add dev eth2 parent ffff: protocol ip prio 10 u32 \
> match ip src 0.0.0.0/0 flowid 1:1 \
